WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,750
So be it

2
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,080
I will give you the money now, thank you auntie

3
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,200
Don't be polite to me

4
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,160
You did a good job

5
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,320
It should be praised

6
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,120
Besides, we have agreed on the price before.

7
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:12,470
Then we'll take down the clothes and trash you don't want. Come on.

8
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:14,910
This time you get 1,500 yuan, Brother Xiao, 700 yuan.

9
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:16,510
Why did you give me so much? Why do you take it?

10
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:17,750
Because I want to get those clothes

11
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:19,150
We collected a little less money

12
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:20,270
This matter is my problem

13
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:21,310
So you take this money

14
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:22,830
Thank you, Brother Xiao, by the way

15
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:24,190
I want to rent a place here tomorrow

16
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:25,150
Where to rent

17
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,790
Do you also want to rent a house?

18
00:00:26,790 --> 00:00:27,910
Then I can find it for you.

19
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:29,870
Anyway, we have too much time and can’t get any jobs.

20
00:00:29,870 --> 00:00:31,070
We'll help you find a house

21
00:00:31,070 --> 00:00:32,590
I don’t want to rent a house like yours

22
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:33,830
Is it quieter?

23
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:35,510
A place where you can put things away

24
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:38,350
You want a place like this? I know it exists.

25
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:39,270
But generally more biased

26
00:00:39,270 --> 00:00:40,470
Not important

27
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:41,750
Don’t I have a tricycle?

28
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:44,030
It’s convenient for me to go anywhere now, so it’s not important

29
00:00:44,030 --> 00:00:45,550
The important thing is that I prefer silence

30
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:46,910
Don't like to disturb other people's homes

31
00:00:46,910 --> 00:00:48,150
And I want to stock up

32
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:50,150
If you want a larger space, I know.

33
00:00:50,150 --> 00:00:51,230
Those places where garbage is collected

34
00:00:51,230 --> 00:00:54,550
Isn’t it the most suitable? Brother Xiao, I know there is a place and I will take you there.

35
00:00:54,550 --> 00:00:55,910
I used to sell that crap

36
00:00:55,910 --> 00:00:57,270
It's quite suitable to go to a place

37
00:00:57,270 --> 00:00:58,910
See if they can rent it over there. If yes,

38
00:00:58,910 --> 00:01:00,390
You can rent a boat directly there

39
00:01:00,390 --> 00:01:02,670
Then let's go early tomorrow, okay?
